  "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Production clean HD hand-painted chibi fantasy sprite, NOT pixel art. Image 1 is Noct's ONE-STAR base form: the exact identity, proportions, camera and art style to keep. Image 2 is Noct's SIX-STAR final form (a faceless Grim Reaper) and shows only where his evolution is heading: use it for darkness level and the violet eye colour, NOT for the robe or the scythe.\nCreate Noct's FOUR-STAR middle form \"Nguyet Anh\" (Moon Shadow), the clear halfway step between Image 1 and Image 2. Keep from Image 1: the same compact chibi shadow-swordsman build and stance, same soft pointed black hood, same completely black hidden face, same dark scarf, small dark boots. Evolve toward Image 2: the gunmetal armour is darker and partly swallowed by a LONGER layered black half-robe and torn cloak whose ragged edges are lined with deep violet; fewer, smaller armour plates (dark forearm guards and shin guards only, no silver chest plate, no belts full of ornaments); the two narrow eyes are a pale lavender-violet with a faint cyan core (between Image 1 cyan and Image 2 violet), small and calm.\nWEAPON (the key change): ONE long single-edged BLACK CRESCENT MOON-BLADE, a curved nodachi-like sword whose blade curves strongly like a crescent moon (a clear hint of the reaper scythe to come), dark blackened steel with a thin pale silver-violet cutting edge, simple dark wrapped grip and small round guard. Held in his right hand, lowered diagonally beside the body with the tip near the ground behind him, close to the body. Free hand relaxed. No second weapon, no dagger, no scythe.\nEverything uses subdued natural painted shading; only the eyes may have a tiny glow. NO aura, NO particles, NO smoke, NO mist, NO magic circle.\n3/4 view facing RIGHT. Exactly EIGHT frames of ONE subtle slow IDLE breathing loop, 2 columns x 4 rows, equal square cells, portrait 1024x2048, read row-major: neutral, inhale, torso lifts slightly, cloak tatters lift, exhale, shoulders settle, cloak settles, neutral. Head and feet stay fixed; only breathing and cloth ripple. FULL BODY (hood top to soles) about 83% of cell height, hood top about 11%, feet at 94% of cell height; fixed body root at 50% cell width; same head size, anatomy size and camera distance in all frames, no per-pose zoom. Entire body and blade inside the cell with at least 5% magenta margin; nothing crosses a cell edge. Background 100% solid flat #FF00FF magenta, no gradient, no floor, no shadow, no text, no labels, no gridlines, no borders.\n",
